ultrasound</article-title><source>Radiologic Clinics of North America</source><year>2001</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>485</fpage><lpage>497</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11506089</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0033-8389(05)70293-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stavros</surname><given-names>AT</given-names></name></person-group><source>Breast Ultrasound</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Philadelphia: Lippincott Williams &#x00026; Wilkins</publisher-name><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15602222</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Madjar</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Practice of Breast Ultrasound. Techniques, Findings Differential Diagnosis</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>New York: Thieme</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Madjar</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rickard</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Jellins</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Otto</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>IBUS guidelines for the ultrasonic examination of the breast. IBUS international faculty. International breast ultrasound school</article-title><source>European Journal of Ultrasound</source><year>1999</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>102</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10099171</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0929-8266(99)00016-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Staren</surname><given-names>ED</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Neill</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name></person-group><articl